# The song the instrumented test hands to the picker. Generated by the same
# script the other checks use, so no audio sits in git — with one deliberate
# exception: scripts/fixtures/ holds an M4A, a FLAC and a variable-bitrate MP3,
# because nothing available to this project can encode those and the app offers
# two of them to the person using it. Its README says why.
